          'C5: The highest and second-highest run-scorers for the winning team '
          'hit an equal number of fours (4s) in the match.\n'
          'C6: The second-highest run-scorer for the winning team was awarded '
          'Player of the Match.\n'
          'C7: The losing team scored more than 10 runs in the final over of '
